      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\ncorresponding law means a law that:\n\n(a) relates to the carrying out of forensic procedures and DNA\ndatabases; and\n\n(b) either:\n\n(i) substantially corresponds to this Part; or\n\n(ii) is prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this\ndefinition.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\ncorresponding law means a law that:\n\n(a) relates to the carrying out of forensic procedures and DNA\ndatabases; and\n\n(b) either:\n\n(i) substantially corresponds to this Part; or\n\n(ii) is prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this\ndefinition.",
      "cml:asserts": [
