      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “and of the Northern Territory”, substitute “, of the Australian\nCapital Territory and of the Northern Territory”.\nNote:\nThe heading to section 43 is altered by omitting “and Northern Territory” and\nsubstituting “, Australian Capital Territory and Northern Territory”.",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “and of the Northern Territory”, substitute “, of the Australian\nCapital Territory and of the Northern Territory”.\nNote:\nThe heading to section 43 is altered by omitting “and Northern Territory” and\nsubstituting “, Australian Capital Territory and Northern Territory”.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
