      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(4A) The court must make an order to dispose of the *controlled\nproperty, or a specified item or items of or a specified portion of\nthe property, if in the court’s opinion the disposal is necessary to\npay, under Part 4-2, a *legal aid commission’s costs.\n\nAmendment of other Acts  Schedule 2\n\nCrimes Legislation Enhancement Act 2003                 19",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(4A) The court must make an order to dispose of the *controlled\nproperty, or a specified item or items of or a specified portion of\nthe property, if in the court’s opinion the disposal is necessary to\npay, under Part 4-2, a *legal aid commission’s costs.\n\nAmendment of other Acts  Schedule 2\n\nCrimes Legislation Enhancement Act 2003                 19",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-2-sec-16d-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-2-sec-16d-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0b433e8912ddffc25629cced575993116e5ec633e11c3b67250a24bf10e5dc87",
      "skos:note": "Court must make order to dispose of controlled property."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003#sch-2-sec-16d",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16D After subsection 280(4)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(4A) The court must make an order to dispose of the *controlled\nproperty, or a specified item or items of or a specified portion of\nthe property, if in the court’s opinion the disposal is necessary to\npay, under Part 4-2, a *legal aid commission’s costs.\n\nAmendment of other Acts  Schedule 2\n\nCrimes Legislation Enhancement Act 2003                 19"
    },
