      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "Note:\nThis corrects a misdescribed amendment of the Crimes Act 1914.\n\nTechnical corrections relating to Part numbering in the Crimes Act 1914  Schedule 3\nSaving provision  Part 6\n\nCrimes Legislation Enhancement Act 2003                 29",
      "skos:definition": "Note:\nThis corrects a misdescribed amendment of the Crimes Act 1914.\n\nTechnical corrections relating to Part numbering in the Crimes Act 1914  Schedule 3\nSaving provision  Part 6\n\nCrimes Legislation Enhancement Act 2003                 29",
