    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-3-sec-42",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42 Saving provision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003#sch-3-sec-42"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Schedule do not invalidate:\n\n(a) an instrument made under, or referring to, a Part of the\nCrimes Act 1914 whose heading is repealed and substituted\nby this Schedule; or\n\n(b) anything done under such an instrument or such a Part.\n(2)\nSubitem (1) has effect whether the instrument was made, or the thing\nwas done, before or after this Act received the Royal Assent.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Schedule do not invalidate:\n\n(a) an instrument made under, or referring to, a Part of the\nCrimes Act 1914 whose heading is repealed and substituted\nby this Schedule; or\n\n(b) anything done under such an instrument or such a Part.\n(2)\nSubitem (1) has effect whether the instrument was made, or the thing\nwas done, before or after this Act received the Royal Assent.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-3-sec-42-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003-sch-3-sec-42-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1d27a191ace8572a10875b59e723cd18c664b9e996bfd14f4be3e2e4350c4b49",
      "skos:note": "Amendments do not invalidate certain instruments or actions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-enhancement-act-2003#sch-3-sec-42",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42 Saving provision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Schedule do not invalidate:\n\n(a) an instrument made under, or referring to, a Part of the\nCrimes Act 1914 whose heading is repealed and substituted\nby this Schedule; or\n\n(b) anything done under such an instrument or such a Part.\n(2)\nSubitem (1) has effect whether the instrument was made, or the thing\nwas done, before or after this Act received the Royal Assent."
    },
